Z||000077||EdsB52||08-07-2001||02:23 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Shaun41178:<BR><B>Yea no kidding why is it your bosses business and why would your freind/coworker care to show it to your boss anyways?  its not his business either.<P>I am almost hoping that you get fired from your job.  Not because I want you to be fired or hope bad things upon you but oh man the lawsuit you would have on your hands right now if you did though.  Can you say millions of dollars??  I could be/act gay for a year or two till I got my millions.  And after that buy a whole bunch of women.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Reminds me of that HOOTERS lawsuit a couple years ago. Recall, that was the one where the male employee was rejected employment based on gender? Who's going to be the next guy to try that, but at a nude strip joint? Mango! (SNL)||||reg||1
